#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:33
msgid "Advertising at Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs 上的广告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is a large open source project funded by ethical advertising "
"which respects user privacy and doesn't track people."
msgstr "Read the Docs 是一个大型开源项目，由尊重用户隐私、不追踪用户的道德广告资助。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:2
msgid "Advertising"
msgstr "广告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Advertising is the single largest source of funding for Read the Docs. It "
"allows us to:"
msgstr "广告是 Read the Docs 最大的单一资金来源。它使我们能够："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:13
msgid "Serve over **35 million pages** of documentation per month"
msgstr "每月提供超过 **3500 万个** 文档页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:14
msgid "Serve over **40 TB** of documentation per month"
msgstr "每月提供超过 **40 TB** 的文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:15
msgid "Host over **80,000 open source projects** and support over **100,000 users**"
msgstr "托管超过 **80,000 个开源项目** ，服务超过 **100,000 名用户**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:16
msgid "Pay a :doc:`small team </team>` of dedicated full-time staff"
msgstr "支付一支专注此项工作的 :doc:`小团队 </team>` 全职人员的薪酬"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"Many advertising models involve tracking users around the internet, selling "
"their data, and privacy intrusion in general. Instead of doing that, we "
"built an :doc:`Ethical Advertising <ethical-advertising>` model that "
"respects user privacy."
msgstr ""
"许多广告模式涉及在互联网上追踪用户、出售其数据以及普遍的隐私侵犯。我们没有这样做，而是构建了尊重用户隐私的 :doc:`道德广告 <ethical-"
"advertising>` 模式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"We recognize that advertising is not for everyone. You may :ref:`opt out of "
"paid advertising <advertising/ethical-advertising:Opting Out>` although you "
"will still see :ref:`community ads <advertising/ethical-"
"advertising:Community Ads>`. `Gold members`_ may also remove advertising "
"from their projects for all visitors."
msgstr ""
"我们认识到广告并非人人适用。你可以 :ref:`选择退出付费广告 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Opting "
"Out>` ，但仍会看到 :ref:`社区广告 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Community Ads>` "
"。`Gold members`_ 还可以为所有访客移除其项目上的广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"For businesses looking to remove advertising, please consider :doc:`Read the"
" Docs Business </commercial/index>`."
msgstr "希望移除广告的企业，请考虑 :doc:`Read the Docs Business </commercial/index>` 。"

